
# ── VISITOR COUNTER ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BLANK = the footer counter reads localStorage, so it shows THIS BROWSER's
# visits only — it is not IP-deduped and not shared between visitors.
# Point it at an endpoint that answers ?club=<clubId> with {"total":n,"today":n}
# (the server does the IP dedupe) and the counter becomes a real site total.
VITE_VisitorCountUrl=
